  "text": "Abere Shiferaw is an emerging Ethiopian author known for his fiction writing in Amharic. Notable Works የበርበሬ ዐውሎ ነፋስ (Chili Peppers Cyclone) — His debut book, which was officially published and launched through Walya Publishing House. የዕድሜ ገበያ — A newly released collection of short stories that hosted its launch event at The Urban Center"
